{"channelId":"UCMk8U2Hmfdxqn3zrCq2g9oQ","row":["The Federalist Society",110000,"The Federalist Society for Law and Public Policy Studies is a group of conservatives and libertarians interested in the current state of the legal order. It is founded on the principles that the state exists to preserve freedom, that the separation of governmental powers is central to our Constitution, and that it is emphatically the province and duty of the judiciary to say what the law is, not what it should be. The Society seeks both to promote an awareness of these principles and to further their application through its activities.\n\nLearn more at https://fedsoc.org.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCMk8U2Hmfdxqn3zrCq2g9oQ","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCMk8U2Hmfdxqn3zrCq2g9oQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:20:54.486Z","channelId":"UCMk8U2Hmfdxqn3zrCq2g9oQ","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"0e56a2753e26d155bf53b25a20192bfc9f63c25e8ccd15a53930b932c6dc8be7","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"0fac83ad3195e02594975814f65a494057b20366de5179f5d5c3a5f151aa69de"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCMk8U2Hmfdxqn3zrCq2g9oQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:20:54.486Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCMk8U2Hmfdxqn3zrCq2g9oQ","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":110000,"raw":"110K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCMk8U2Hmfdxqn3zrCq2g9oQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:20:54.486Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"massage therapist","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"unconfirmed","role":"undetermined","flags":["当前仅有相关内容或名称线索，尚无匹配的本人专业简介；不列入职业联系优选"],"sourceUrls":[]}],"cleanup":{"status":"review","code":"biography_audience_review","reason":"简介上下文未证明本人与目标人群的关系；保留原记录，不猜测身份。","keywords":[],"role":"undeterm